{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1538,
  "batch_count": 1682,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "f1c6893d60a8989361cfd9c371f56bc8ec25f81d",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57da12ca336f4375091e9a2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还算…可以吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "69bdbb3929f9b4c354e5623d115a5b842e2d642c1ee3cfe6dce556a28d46a5e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f34f94e071defcba254757db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "将经验活用于下一战吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd8fc4451c6712251c91edc55828957ef8cd01bb2b201c215808c3645c3e9d83",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0867b4c497834af9bc29f51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会尽快制定对策的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f171341df313f1bba90e3de7b157fb2c8e23b269c7b6ce07ad152891ee5e78e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a7892c3221970ad10900301",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这真是何等模样…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3f3d8e8d9405446351592eca5b5fdbb1ce2dd79e560e84e82811536eae87060",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1ea258f2b40b87b4d85c44e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我这双引以为傲的腿，其力量…\r\n您可曾好好印入双眼？",
      "source_fingerprint": "673fce39876764c2aeb707b430f4bf0f62f6fc47b527366fd0c236c0f8ba330d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14d01a60cb4fc356c679cecf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这极致的旅程…您可曾品味？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8ca81375a36a7c7eb5870b8daa9417d52d1a7cf7f7f7230f9f48f69478f3855",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9951363a0be61f4ab82d8156",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "该出发了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4719027dea87e9e0a68efe11c0ca2a779bd0fadc7a1fdeb51189fab13aacb6b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:360b93f8f7b7fc0b6b67a6c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "启程吧。向着旅途的尽头…",
      "source_fingerprint": "4859230b12805e0612ae4678686b08c0d2022c7a594a5bbca533cf6f9b50e15d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:863ca196b5c0c384e0f0c4ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "时机正好。就由我带您踏上…这如梦似幻般的\r\n极致之旅。来吧――",
      "source_fingerprint": "f38854f6acb74c53e4f53f106a6e1b54cc2d4b81dfc927b9d855b683406a09be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1bb54ad17be210f7ba252407",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请由我为您献上梦幻般的舞台吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3417b04cb24641b1a33eb1f9f9b417e0add827916c8c504c044681b364476fa1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d337ef930adec2ee2b5576f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "向粉丝们致以最诚挚的感谢之情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a2edfda92c2841478abd56ab971b4a13323b7c662f74f2a77ea4afbec21a06e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc4a7bf9a77f90fa1c3ee11b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我们一起去见证旅途的尽头吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cef4d8054d2860e4bfcfca2d0f444192738725dfc39e844caef68987b613a29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df5d7a30db873ada8634407e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您的温柔给了我\r\n莫大的支持。对我而言、\r\n您是无可替代的人…训练员",
      "source_fingerprint": "46701983f51ab83931d948736804a2f245bc385259533273529ca0ef25fdc769",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e76057615aecf2115c98f0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "保养我每天都有在做哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d6b08ff48ab6bbdc28f1ef607ad159ca875c4c94719e4a4fa7b583bae959998",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcc83c74b5d3224c937feac2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是件不太常穿的设计呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "998524118313db8c6c599c23e7c398cde45fccb01b540cc7e688a41f48b4f78c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52bbdc987cef06429c22f7ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟平时给人的印象有所不同吗？\r\n…呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "685eb4d472db0669db808bfcdcb7aee448095e67b7ab939bac65370b5ad9d6d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25256bd51b9d4b3527d388ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "制服…真是便利的符号。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eae7a2b7c6c7d63c2a79ec3c3145d1ad72c2aa80174109e0700a886061e907fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5025d8f41ac8dd54c148032a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我算是比较擅长记舞步的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8781d076a0a36f1fb5f2492665dd95624268f10f711bb027f6c3784d6a7822c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ee700c613290451091e1854",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的骄傲…这就请您过目。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f78401dcdb094c05b0d1d52c903f193a1f2887c46db357dbda778875119dccc5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06a8435ad73146b20023e00c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "白色很让你感到意外吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "03e48faa73bf16b65fc89d0a225c3c97f8ac582d1d55436dde52b7bb8a0377a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77504921df90bff11d0c119f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "宴会之上 享受者才是赢家；不是吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6db296f10ec5d631e959518ef57632e79058fee72652ad2221c9cdb4b70a8e8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef8451e8ef35598fe38abd83",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "必须根据用途，来区分使用呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac7baffadf7df822349a280ed0ccd62632f5915f6899a6c0d79bc83c9dc72b09",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae8a6a03661cebb67831c9c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能够驾驭的服装，其实并不多呢…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8170c83e93c248caa71992d7568bea8921c95d21cc96a1e20c579b6fd1d53f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14cc78a4a7a3a123ab866d13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "保养我每天都有在做哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d6b08ff48ab6bbdc28f1ef607ad159ca875c4c94719e4a4fa7b583bae959998",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66f6cee044d6eefe1c6a7887",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是件不太常穿的设计呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "998524118313db8c6c599c23e7c398cde45fccb01b540cc7e688a41f48b4f78c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d3d8f962742f2d404786f5a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟平时给人的印象有所不同吗？\r\n…呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "685eb4d472db0669db808bfcdcb7aee448095e67b7ab939bac65370b5ad9d6d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1de40e55e37675c7a2b19ea9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "制服…真是便利的符号。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eae7a2b7c6c7d63c2a79ec3c3145d1ad72c2aa80174109e0700a886061e907fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28159904f80a4203489c26f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我算是比较擅长记舞步的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8781d076a0a36f1fb5f2492665dd95624268f10f711bb027f6c3784d6a7822c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60d08d9bbf7f95ab994ea236",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的骄傲…这就请您过目。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f78401dcdb094c05b0d1d52c903f193a1f2887c46db357dbda778875119dccc5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:479a26306a189c6bf5c89ab6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "白色很让你感到意外吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "03e48faa73bf16b65fc89d0a225c3c97f8ac582d1d55436dde52b7bb8a0377a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "71016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:271f0bebdeadcb0c75571872",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "宴会之上 享受者才是赢家；不是吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6db296f10ec5d631e959518ef57632e79058fee72652ad2221c9cdb4b70a8e8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "71017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b26cbd006c3432bd139eb36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "必须根据用途，来区分使用呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac7baffadf7df822349a280ed0ccd62632f5915f6899a6c0d79bc83c9dc72b09",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca7b8b0876089db966dd63db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能够驾驭的服装，其实并不多呢…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8170c83e93c248caa71992d7568bea8921c95d21cc96a1e20c579b6fd1d53f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:057adae2b0329a63bc0b75cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您辛苦了",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c66b4f55c5118eb3422a15de80e2dbb10b124f0ec293414ae4795652d3dae2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a19f4b2e34ba71d572d2490",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早晨的时光总觉得很短暂呢…\r\n光顾着看小匠的睡颜\r\n一转眼时间就过去了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcb3186cf306faa6970abcc0fabf8b10b4ec4abf0f32b3b82349f59d1356b864",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ef62e277802198fcc70acf9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦呀，您看起来有些没睡醒呢。请不要太\r\n勉强自己。我也会来给您帮忙的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef6751060ce3a0fc328f2b19a79ecb51b4188c6d339e4619bca7ab6687448a27",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4281e6d706b6f6bd60159e50",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "食堂里、看起来很挤呢\r\n方便的话请到屋顶上来。我有些话\r\n想边吃午餐边和您说。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0908180e3cef5b193a12008d8c9622b3c104b2ede39bc107bdc64acfccb97d33",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:758db6f6408f23b8298ddafa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要我泡些能提神的玉露吗？\r\n差不多到了睡魔会来滋扰\r\n的时候了。不必客气。",
      "source_fingerprint": "107f1cb89a6b938003cf24b2a5725b33cfb1e9980bcede102a0c0af33fca64e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df42c54c064df6b2d7de68b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是时候得补充些茶叶了…\r\n因为小匠总是喜欢\r\n在睡前喝杯甘菊茶。",
      "source_fingerprint": "06b824c28900556a55e17b23b14e22a8057b534e441e148feade8b7065e96ad2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9cde2f52507be441c4ac0e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夜晚会将一切都笼罩起来…\r\n真是段温馨的时光。",
      "source_fingerprint": "96089e03c0b0c19dba5958406965ca2fb67d658fba28352917907a2d03b3c164",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60f85659554b48371c4730bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个季节、大家似乎都有些\r\n轻飘飘的呢…真是可爱。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8679743cf61ab9a68a8deaf20f4fe1b019a026ebc8246b9cb4c4e36ce359c377",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e1ea48fd98350731ebb56c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每年我都会和家人\r\n一起外出去避暑呢。今年也\r\n必须准备好完美的行程计划才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c192068ef21767cb1d224eb5d87cca0d413f1893d02248a889e0bcd86c9b1a3a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:247536ef300d641cb3b841cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大姐头发邮件来了呢。\r\n那张照片里的红叶…\r\n呵呵，我也真想亲眼看看啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7611034cd6351fb14d8a5e5eae7ab52eb40992e5599d3ea77d5d3bf78853ed50",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a75335269292e098953cdb0d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下雪之类的天气会很麻烦呢…\r\n日程就按照天气情况\r\n来灵活地调整吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d5aaf84662f6a791dba569b8b062113db7fadc5fdb98a560ada89a1ff01eede",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5fb482a09cb1bf996ce7357",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…怎么了这是？\n眼睛眯成这个样子。\n啊…是太耀眼了吗；毕竟这是朝阳。",
      "source_fingerprint": "79064631b5351d4a07978e2893d695f60fae32d844517ed40e7f31e665d032ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1025b34d3a8183e25005973b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身披白金光尘飘散的静谧清晨；\n心情自然也会变得严肃。\n背也会不由地挺直呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d49923106fd956dd20a7dfd52a225d8081fd6a026da338e6c96307a92b094ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3ca442a0ff3d54687212a1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天与我问候的人格外多，\n呵呵，真开心呢。不知不觉\n就说了很多话，聊了很多事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1c6d60530caa2707acce1dc932c1e9fce9e9248b3aac472482bc67347a6d186",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa30a063c1ed4465bc2200e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "接下来打算去委员会室。我想给\n午睡中的小匠准备一杯提神的饮品\n…或许是尼尔吉里的柠檬茶吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "45700c0379b38fd5c181bde91ed69f93e0e319b118773a8eb602016812e080b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a76fba76b0f475d82cca0e93",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只是在晚上散步而已。无须担心，\n这身衣服在黑暗中挺显眼的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0575f8d7b8b9e0adc79a3f1f82cf3c562af915f8d57951a8d85cc35fc4f07fa9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7954c467ef41f6665cba13a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦呀、还是被发现了么。\n能请您保密吗？\n今晚；在这里见过我的这件事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "51430eedf2e95e40ac5644f03c89fad27d0faa3c367c46e8f45af6d03607d72a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4779a2d14a6ceb7dad7f8323",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个时候入学的新生们，青涩纯真\n真是耀眼夺目呢。简直就像\n清晨的露珠般独有的那份透亮。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7564f41fa623da3fdcac81dd2f509f55f373cdf46bf108b7268f8a51071b025f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d082e3ebf2ebf56ef6247892",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没出汗让您有点不可思议；是吗？\n因为我能够收放自如地控制出汗呢。\n…开玩笑的。呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea643889f3470a17798af48088832640498ee9155ebfd367f5ebc8883997499b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3915b926ea54e9075798cfb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "或许是天凉的缘故，无论是比赛还是嬉戏；\n大家都格外充满活力呢。\n没错，我也不例外。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6d1d1a3b5ef453bc1bd50c4efa22024c9977169be5ef32229fdf3a5e778342f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9d1236d8ba438ea9e4963a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你看起来很冷呢。对你来说；\n冬天是个很辛苦的季节吧？\n…平日里的指导，真的很感谢哟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "45d23783a3dcd2264840805d571c75dbfdf5cd1f295728743f17c8170f91c1b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1abad8a265a67a835f77f1cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请做个甜美的梦吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5b2963b0faf45df10ba6b909527ff4d2c40d77f87b4a3e60a811228776d7aba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76b094db16e9dcbb86f49508",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大姐头…不晓得又跑到\r\n哪里去了呢。呵呵，偏偏在我\r\n想要见她的时候总是这样…",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd627f8991128194c74e2816a136301a18764bb9db05b6817a6e4d953b6c56fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:740acb14d00e8425d3927bfa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "妈妈是个情深义重的人。和爸爸的\r\n感情也很好…呵呵、下次\r\n再送他们一对旅行券当做礼物吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6c425eb5602a52ad155383282dd9c2f307018d167e3bf5d9b4511a2f613f4cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbe6c64158084df9802aa6e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "迷人同学实在是\r\n可爱极了，人也很好…\r\n呵呵、要被她晃得睁不开眼了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4a4731b8e166d56d0a98cdfd7d3712314dc125352dfa40d7ed659d09f9d32d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ce9ad56e9a134f449b81026",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阿船同学和中山同学\r\n总是会去逗小匠开心呢\r\n…真是令人欣慰的一幕啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b61c9615c3cb13f33d1b5b41788c684948e111a06ba777bb636a51846454f405",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4aa7922525dceb4323f5ca7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我算是喜欢读书的哦。从一般读物\r\n到专业书籍、涉猎很广泛。\r\n…毕竟，知识就是力量呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "acb0aef17235991258fbc3e7206d42eb5dbbc8231a2fe150740c1f91d73d85aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76c2089db23ec9ca98729656",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "统一的服装可以增强\r\n彼此间的归属感呢。\r\n我觉得这是件好事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ecfec3e163f146633c54671b070a91fd0d8a232e6eee733342bb55c97a65b07",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04a60dac36d366e78c630d2f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为个子小、我一站上舞台就很\r\n显眼。却总被人评价说：\r\n“很有精气神”、反而让我有点不好意思了呢",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa5c5655b7d383a691330621d68162d8bf5934dfb6856a543da39755f2c5d472",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fed18265feb50d1de1a1509b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以黑色为基调，\r\n代表着我的决心…应该可以这么说吧。\r\n毕竟颜色也有着各式各样的效果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdecbe04139229a63704580f2b871223199d72d1080000da3805f618ec32edb5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52470bb978a2447ef7c7b608",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "毕竟是“决胜”服…呢。\r\n必须端正仪态严肃以待才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1925af46e122d263044263921e8935967e1652b9f4584bc79b41b1eb8f62f21",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:304a3fabdbc1d98235aa3825",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上果然还是\r\n适合喝浅烘的咖啡呢。\r\n能让头脑更清醒些。",
      "source_fingerprint": "afc6a966d560c014890ffc70f8b67347eedc25ffec867e126afab7b5e9079be0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bfb746b686caf855bf11ce2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您有看到数学老师\r\n在哪里吗？我把他交给我的\r\n资料搬完了，想找他汇报一下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "86ac447c498d922c1cb8a4a231475779e3106050061c2203a33280e3675304ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c47e51b65e5c42f9df91d83",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "熬夜对身体不好哦。\r\n…至于我 您不必担心，\r\n我没关系的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "71bf79cfe64759e33e70ff7a4ce0c76add500cf4d71bbf480a8e033beb9c4861",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1735bf674e80e0665d8e9f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "又到了鲷鱼最好吃的季节了呢。\r\n我常去的那家店，\r\n做的鲷鱼茶泡饭很美味哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a03e4b5db6d435eb9e38acf882df8f80c8e1ec5dbc37830c6efb87c2c4d5416",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7bba5d15047baa533272df8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏天去地方的远征会变多呢…\r\n为了让大家能有更舒适、\r\n更有收获的旅程，我必须尽力而为。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eda1575f4221a385b6ba95af09b9171e9841db1cdf47f7687b8617f9aa6acc92",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df3697fafb593fb182decaaa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "果然还是用铁壶泡的茶最好…\r\n天气也逐渐转凉了、等小匠午休后\r\n给她泡上一杯吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "945f581601af2f2479bb77c3109fdecf7995f105dbb3dcf73f053922c68d2b41",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31685d2dca49c38978300760",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近越来越冷了…果然还是想要\r\n最新款的板式取暖器呢…啊，\r\n我是在说委员会的事。您不必在意。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec863534f683493eb8e1409e28ce682657c1a32f720b90df308fbc3166fefd68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33dd07ada81d187d3fbbcd33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看到骏骥同学热心维护校园治安，\n实在令我感激。毕竟有些问题\n不是一味地息事宁人就能解决的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4215d77d9a5cc19d6d224c99146a59c4fb2f413e8b7e4e79cdad96b08f7a75c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb0894e3909b4370b17b1887",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大姐头的旅行目的真是难以捉摸呢。\n究竟是有明确的计划；还是随意的漫游。\n连我也揣测不透啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9f2e36298f0d936aaee1de218ae89480e9f63d66668bc9c2138f5550c4bf498",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75f8e9a903cff59f3d8eb076",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "常出现在道路旁和背景里的小真人偶…\n…真弓同学的创造力；\n是我所不具备的。有点意思——",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc88b5444b8088015a7ced118aa24bb1f9b6b1c5ca3f06d2b8bc96fc8a78896f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74e2256aaf1495e76824ea21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辣妹圈存在着她们独有的文化。\n呵呵，和佐敦同学的交流；\n真是极大的激发了我的求知欲呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d07a54503fa95513749bbdce2a339f94de9504ac70f4439a7b0a5c14e4f26aa7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe05fdf81c5df08dd2172540",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天和紫丁同学约好了一起喝茶。\n和她共处的时光总是很愉快却又意犹未尽。\n小匠似乎也很喜欢她呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5323b5055fb4515dba17cec20982a699d17444cfded4b016371843888aeb896b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ddf78367be1fedb072a2226",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今早，梳头打理的时候\n稍微要比平时多花了些时间。\n想利索的把头发盘起来也挺难呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "780957846fb2735728be23cdd0b85c93e9718561afa27a1dc777e69fb889d8dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57b2edb074dee52815e2e275",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午餐二选一；\n那不勒斯意面、亦或咖喱乌冬。\n没错，这是中山同学给我的建议。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ecf4067657f64652500f5623368b4d11eadda41f8309a5a22a0b54990cda4c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7187e11ea3c08d68cafaab18",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "快乐的时光总是短暂的呢。\n这个共享狂热与欢喜的特别之地。\n…真希望、派对能永远持续下去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae7df67a0269f1e52cbad8419c9d6e055f7c8754a12c32d4591c028ce27183cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d468f899ca1815d263b7ebc7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "樱花盛开时固然绚丽；\n但花筏也别有一番风味哦。\n也许这就是所谓的余韵悠长吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2dcaaa3db1d8296be683f2a4f21411e5d0fcf0ed40fc0bd5e3d83c078519766",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "91024"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
